    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan obtained rule path Immortal Gu Big from Purple Mountain True Monarch, a miniman Gu Immortal. When the miniman used Big, his body expanded and he became a human Gu Immortal. Fang Yuan’s modified fixed luck takes precaution Immortal Gu and Big as its core in place of stubborn Immortal Gu and rule path Immortal Gu Main, and the modification succeeds only partially.",
